[{"id":4117544583,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc71bL6H","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- The bottom panel is also hidden when it's maximized using this icon:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"131\" height=\"45\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/21cfaf65-c5cd-4381-b40b-33fc523556ff\" />\r\n\r\nI don't think it should be hidden in this case, as you intend to be maximizing the screen real estate for the bottom panel (e.g. to view large outputs in the Output panel, or large shaders in the Shader Editor panel).\r\n\r\n- Note that this does not completely hide the bottom panel, but merely collapse it when toggling distraction-free mode. You can still expand the bottom panel again (<kbd>Ctrl + J</kbd> comes handy here), switch to a different bottom panel or look at the engine version. I think it's fine this way, but I figure I'd point it out.\r\n\r\n  - To take \"true fullscreen\" screenshots of the 2D/3D editor viewport, https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11793 could be useful.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118502#pullrequestreview-4117544583","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118502","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118502#pullrequestreview-4117544583"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118502"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-15T23:46:01Z","commit_id":"705e5c79bb0b7b4e823c7d2f7b9eaec477cac255"},{"id":4554395883,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD3aQ6w","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?u=ec87bf81cd2f5f0947670400f48cf0845c25d719&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested, works as expected, UX makes sense as I always want both hidden and end up having to press two hotkeys. I agree with Calinou that bottom panel shouldn't be hidden when maximized.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118502#pullrequestreview-4554395883","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoten